    "definition_mismatch_with_kashmir": "peer = public STU fleet; Kashmir 1,011 = planned ALL-operator fleet (absorbs private minibus permits + SSCL/CHALO e-buses). The regression benchmarks public STU provision, not a like-for-like target.",
